Yet another Xconq5.3 bug... this is related to simultaneous movement:
  When a computer player attacks a unit that is just about to come up in the
  move queue and destroys it, the game will still tell you to move the non-exist-
  ent piece.  Since you can't move the piece (as it is no longer there), the 
  game hangs and no amount of fiddling will wake it back up.  Argh.


